PoxIsles_Text_MansionGuide::
	.string "That's the old research house.\nNobody has lived in it since the\lfire.\pBLAINE keeps it locked and keeps\nthe key on him. He'll lock a\lhouse. He won't lock a GYM.$"

PoxIsles_Text_MansionGuide_1::
	.string "So he gave you the SECRET KEY.\nHe doesn't do that.\pMind the statues inside. Press\none and half the doors shut\lwhile the other half open.\pThere's a SAGE in the basement\nwho came over on the supply\lboat. He isn't lost. He's\lkeeping something company.$"

PoxIsles_Text_MansionGuide_2::
	.string "You were in there a long time.\nYou came out reading the ground,\lthe way BLAINE does.\pI'll keep an eye on the door.\nSomebody should.$"

PoxIsles_Text_GymRegular::
	.string "The GYM is up the street, door\nwide open since spring. Six\lquestions and a man who hates to\llose.\pI have a week of tomatoes on you\nmissing question four. Everybody\lmisses question four.$"

PoxIsles_Text_GymRegular_1::
	.string "Six for six, or did you fight\nyour way through? Don't tell me.\lI'll say six.\pBLAINE hasn't handed that key to\nanyone in years. Use it before\lhe thinks better of it.$"

PoxIsles_Text_GymRegular_2::
	.string "The whole island knows you went\nthrough the house. Nobody is\lgoing to ask what was in it.\pWe bet on quiz doors here. We\ndon't bet on that.$"

PoxIsles_Text_DockHand::
	.string "Sea's flat as a plate and I\nstill can't take you anywhere.\lThe ferry is off the timetable.\pThe east channel is for people\nwith business east. Yours is\lwith BLAINE first.$"

PoxIsles_Text_DockHand_1::
	.string "That's BLAINE's key in your bag.\nHis rule: nobody crosses with\lthe house on the hill still\lunread.\pHe wants it used, not carried\noff the island.$"

PoxIsles_Text_DockHand_2::
	.string "Read the lot, did you. Then the\neast channel is yours.\pStraight out from this quay and\nhold for the black rock. The\ldoor into SEAFOAM is on its\lsouth face.$"

PoxIsles_Text_Greenhouse::
	.string "The ash is good for one thing.\nTomatoes.\pWe pipe the hot water under the\nbeds. Ripe in midwinter, and\lthey taste a little of matches.$"

PoxIsles_Text_LabTech::
	.string "Coffee break. The pot in the LAB\nhasn't been switched off since\lbefore I was hired.\pWe revive fossils, mostly. It's\nquieter work than what they used\lto do up the hill.$"

PoxIsles_Text_IceCutter::
	.string "I cut ice for the MOSSDEEP\nboats. Thirty blocks a tide,\lwhen the cave lets me.\pShove the boulders down the\nholes and they dam the current\lbelow. Walk out before the job\lis done and the water takes the\lrocks back.$"

PoxIsles_Text_IceCutter_1::
	.string "Hear that? Nothing. The lower\nchannel hasn't been this quiet\lsince I was a boy.\pIt'll hold now. Good work,\nwhoever did it.$"

PoxIsles_Text_Swimmer::
	.string "I swam in from the MOSSDEEP side\nto get out of the sun. Flat\lwater the whole way.\pYou'll see the launch tower\nbefore you see the beach.$"

PoxIsles_Text_Angler::
	.string "Two hours out of CINNABAR and\nthe wind turned. My line has\lbeen dry since the turn.\pThe cave breathes on the ebb. If\nyou can feel it pulling, you're\lalready at the door.$"

PoxIsles_Text_CaveSign::
	.string "SEAFOAM ISLANDS - WEST DOOR\nNo landing past this rock.\pWatch the swell.$"

PoxIsles_Text_SaffronSailor::
	.string "The north shore runs up ROUTE 19\nto SAFFRON. The water gets you\lthere long before the gate lets\lyou in.\pThe city has been shut a good\nwhile. Nobody has said why. I\ljust turn the boats around.$"

PoxIsles_Text_SaffronSailor_1::
	.string "SAFFRON is open. It came down\nthe wire this morning and nobody\lhere looked surprised but me.\pNorth shore, ROUTE 19, same as\never. Only now the gate is the\leasy part.$"

PoxIsles_Text_LaunchBoard::
	.string "The launch board outside the\nSPACE CENTER says soon. The date\lunder it has been pasted over\lthree times.\pWhen it goes, the school shuts\nand the boats stay in. So we all\lwatch the board.$"

PoxIsles_Text_LaunchBoard_1::
	.string "They pasted a fourth date on the\nlaunch board. Then somebody took\lthe board down.\pI don't know what they found\nover there. They have stopped\larguing about the wind, I know\lthat.$"

PoxIsles_Text_DockClerk::
	.string "You came out of the cave? Then\nyou're the first thing I've\llogged all morning.\pFerry is at six and six. The GYM\nis up the hill, and the white\lroof past it is the SPACE\lCENTER.$"

PoxIsles_Text_SchoolKid::
	.string "The board says the next launch\nis soon. It has said soon since\lmy brother was little.\pWe get the day off when it goes.\nI've had my bag packed for a\lyear.$"

PoxIsles_Text_BlaineNotReady::
	.string "BLAINE: Not yet. Four BADGES and\na reason to be here. That is the\ldoor charge on this island.\pCome back with both.$"

PoxIsles_Text_TwinsNotReady::
	.string "TATE: Not yet.\nLIZA: Not quite yet.\pTATE: Five BADGES, and the long\nway round by sea.\pLIZA: Then we'll play.$"

PoxIsles_Text_TwinsTwoMons::
	.string "TATE: It takes two…\nLIZA: …on both sides.\pTATE: Bring two POKéMON that can\nstill stand.\pLIZA: We'll wait.$"

PoxIsles_Text_TwinsDone::
	.string "TATE: You already beat us.\nLIZA: We remember. We were there.\pTATE: The SPACE CENTER is east of\nthe GYM.\pLIZA: Past the white rock.$"

PoxIsles_Text_Archive1Sealed::
	.string "The cabinet is locked. The\nkeyhole is small and brass, the\lsame pattern as the front door.$"

PoxIsles_Text_Archive2Sealed::
	.string "FILE 2 is tied shut with string.\nA card under the knot reads:\lFILE 1 FIRST.$"

PoxIsles_Text_Archive3Sealed::
	.string "FILE 3 is tied shut with string.\nA card under the knot reads: IN\lSEQUENCE. NO EXCEPTIONS.$"

PoxIsles_Text_SpaceBusy::
	.string "Sorry, I can't stop. It's\nfeeding time, and then the chief\lwants the logs.\pIf you're here about the survey,\nhe's at the big console.$"

PoxIsles_Text_ReportBusy::
	.string "Not now. I'm in the middle of a\ncount.\pCome back when TATE and LIZA\nhave signed off on you. I want\lsomeone who has walked the whole\lroad, from the start to here.$"

PoxIsles_Text_VolcanoBadge::
	.string "{PLAYER} received the VOLCANO BADGE\nfrom BLAINE.$"

PoxIsles_Text_BlaineAfter::
	.string "BLAINE: You read them. I can\ntell. People come out of that\lhouse walking slower.\pI kept that door shut for thirty\nyears because I didn't\lunderstand what was behind it. I\lstill don't. Now it's your\lproblem as well.\pThe east quay will take you on.\nTell FUJI I kept my end.$"

PoxIsles_Text_MindBadge::
	.string "TATE: Best game all season.\nLIZA: Take the MIND BADGE.\p{PLAYER} received the MIND BADGE\nfrom TATE and LIZA.\pTATE: The SPACE CENTER people…\nLIZA: …count things.\pTATE: Go and be counted.$"

PoxIsles_Text_SeaClosed::
	.string "A sharp whistle from the quay.\nThe DOCK HAND is waving you back\lto shore.\pThe east channel isn't open to\nyou yet.$"

PoxIsles_Text_CrossingClosed::
	.string "The crossing to SEAFOAM is\nrunning hard. Your POKéMON turns\lback for the beach.$"
